Hanumān tells Maināka rest Surasā test and Siṃhikā slaying --- Hanumān searches palace misses Sītā finds her in Aśōka --- Rāvaṇa threatens two-month deadline and Sītā defies abduction --- Mandōdarī halts killing and Rākṣasīs threaten wailing Sītā --- Hanumān gives ring gains trust and takes jewel message --- Hanumān wrecks grove slays Kiṅkaras Jambumāli minister sons --- Hanumān kills five generals and Akṣa then yields to Indrajit noose --- Hanumān preaches Rāma Sugrīva alliance and demands Sītā return --- Vibhīṣaṇa saves envoy from death to tail burning --- Hanumān breaks bonds burns Laṅkā hears Sītā safe and returns
